                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Deserialize a JSON array into a List of Student objects.
                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Use JsonPropertyName to customize JSON property names.
                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Use JsonIgnore to exclude a property from JSON.
                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Create an ASP.NET Core Web API endpoint that returns
                        student data as JSON.
                    </li>

                    <li class="mb-2">
                        Serialize a product object and display the generated
                        JSON.
                    </li>
                </ol>

            </div>


